---
import {ABOUT} from '@lib/constants';
---

<div
  id={ABOUT}
  class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-[16px] lg:px-[40px] py-[64px] lg:py-[100px] flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-[24px] lg:gap-[64px]"
>
  <div class="lg:w-[200px] lg:flex-shrink-0">
    <div
      class="text-h8 lg:text-h7 font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-accent-cyan"
    >
      About
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-[22px] max-w-[700px]">
    <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-[26px] lg:text-h4 text-color-main">
      Builder PM.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[16px] lg:text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-text-secondary">
      I've spent two decades in product management across AI agents, CRM,
      AdTech, and data analytics — from a founding team that grew revenue
      from zero to $15M, to leading next-generation CRM at Google scale.
      What's stayed constant is a bias toward direct execution: rather than
      handing a system off in a spec, I design the architecture, coordinate
      the work across AI agents, and apply product taste, design judgment,
      and user insight to get it built and working.
    </p>
    <p class="text-[16px] lg:text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-text-secondary">
      I've also seen AI development from the other side, as a compensated
      OpenAI Red Team contributor assessing the risk and safety profile of
      pre-release models — and through product and AI leadership roles at
      other startups and large corporates along the way.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-[6px] text-h7 text-text-muted leading-[1.6]">
      MBA, University of Southern California &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; MEngSc
      Biomedical Engineering, UNSW Sydney &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; B.S. Chemistry
      &amp; B.S. Electrical Engineering, University of Illinois Urbana&ndash;Champaign
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
